      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DAYSOFWINEN ROSES (1) is stepping out for the first time. By Always B Miki and hails from the J J Yeomans stable. Will enjoy a nice run from this favourable starting position. Was not far away in a recent trial. Finds a nice race so anticipating a bright start to her career. SHES CAPTIVATING (3) lines up for the first time. By Capt Midnight and hails from the K A Stuart-Mitchell stable. Has the benefit of a good draw. Looks to have some ability based on a recent trial win. Finds a nice race so anticipating a bright start to her career. IDEAL FRANKIE (4) is taking on a far easier race this time after finishing ninth in a Group One at her latest appearance over 1660m at Albion Park, beaten 30 metres by Havtimemajor. Drawn well and down significantly in grade so watch for a much better run. SOHO SPARKLE (2) is ready to improve this prep after debuting with a modest seventh five-and-a-half months ago over 1730m at Bathurst.",
